  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "Mix components thoroughly and adjust pH to 6.8. Distribute the medium into culture vessels under a N2--CO2 (9:1, v/v) gas mixture, seal with butyl rubber stoppers and autoclave. After cooling, add the following solution(per 960 ml) from anaerobic stock (filter-sterilized)"
    }
  ]
}